  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, smoked paprika and cayenne pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add ground pork and cook, breaking up with a spoon, until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add chicken broth, salt and black pepper and bring to a boil.",
    "Transfer to a slow cooker and cook on low for 2 hours or high for 1 hour.",
    "Stir in heavy cream and cook for an additional 10-15 minutes.",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve over couscous or rice."
